#!/usr/bin/env beg

Accept a request ID and a directory. Recursively search current .log files
and rotated .log.* files, including gzip-compressed files.

A record starts with an ISO 8601 timestamp at the beginning of a line and
continues through the line before the next timestamp. The first line can
contain a request_id= field whose value ends at whitespace.

Print records for the exact request ID in chronological order, including every
continuation line. Print identical records only once, including across files.
Exit 1 if nothing matched or 2 if an input could not be read.
